# Responsive Design

## Breakpoints (Tailwind)
- `sm`: 640px, `md`: 768px, `lg`: 1024px, `xl`: 1280px, `2xl`: 1440px.
- Mobile-first: viết class mobile trước, `md:`/`lg:` override.

## Grid / Layout
- Desktop: 2-column grid (`lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]`).
- Tablet/mobile: 1-col, padding `container-page`.
- Section padding: `py-16 md:py-20`, `py-20 md:py-24`.

## Typography scaling
- Dùng `clamp()` cho font size: `text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3rem)]`.
- Line height: 1.04–1.12 cho heading, 1.6–1.75 cho body.

## Touch targets
- Nút nhấn tối thiểu 40×40px (`md:hidden` menu toggle 44×44).
- Form input padding ≥ 12px.

## Mobile menu
- Component: `<MobileMenu>` trong Header.
- `<details>`/`:focus-within` pattern — keyboard-accessible.